{"data":{"body":"[P2] Apply the preview budget before materializing the document\n\nThe traversal now stops at the budget, but `readTree` first allocates the complete JSON tree. Large payloads can still duplicate the whole document and exhaust heap for a 4 KB preview. Use streaming JSON traversal that stops once the budget is full, and cover this with a large-document test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogA51","finding_digest":"5569849aaa6f231cfcab68b6fef126eb700831658d28e1c3d0a4d8d653c1b3aa","finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","finding_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","identity_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","line":54,"observation_digest":"3ae60b56c27991cce269f79fb710d2bee86e2ffa5dace72375fe50e8975ffda0","observation_id":"aro_v1_hltawvwcpgi4zytj66p3oegsx3","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:12:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tb7tctryogk3ld253sdhjwzl32","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"f001a8f1de90bbda6c82b737ad83e0252bf513d0","reviewer":"codex","start_line":54,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_qitwbym7272zjmz3yqromqmk4c","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:12:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
